        "class_code": "EFFICACY",
        "approval_date": "2012-05-22",
        "description": {
          "text": "Labeling update adding clinical studies and safety data for linagliptin used in combination with metformin (trial 1218.46), not a new indication",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "These changes are based on the safety and efficacy results from trial 1218.46, entitled \u201cA Phase 3, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled parallel group study to compare the efficacy and safety of twice daily administration of the free combination of linagliptin 2.5 mg + metformin 500 mg or of linagliptin 2.5 mg + metformin 1000 mg, with the individual components of metformin (500 mg or 1000 mg, twice daily) and linagliptin (5 mg, once daily) over 24 weeks in drug naive or previously treated (4 weeks washout and 2 weeks placebo run-in) type 2 diabetic patients with insufficient glycemic control.\u201d The efficacy and safety of trial 1218.46 was fully reviewed under the Jentadueto (linagliptin/metformin fixed-dose combination) NDA (201281).",
              "doc_id": "da5eb2f6-3457-51d3-a16d-db9c6e2a2b75",
              "line": 8
            }
          ]
        },
        "review_url": null,
        "letter_url": "https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/appletter/2012/201280s002ltr.pdf",
        "label_url": "https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2012/201280s002lbl.pdf",
        "review_doc_id": null
